OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for rape and abuse of
OL,4,Awoman
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who repeatedly raped and abused a
OL,7,Fwoman has been jailed for 16 years.
OL,9,FNottinghamshire Police said Sheik
OL,10,FHameed carried out some of the offences
OL,11,Fin the victim's home and other
OL,12,Flocations in the county, and also
OL,13,F"filmed himself committing offences".
OL,15,FThe 22-year-old was found guilty of
OL,16,Ffour counts of rape, two counts of
OL,17,Fsexual assault by penetration, two
OL,18,Fcounts of sexual assault and two counts
OL,19,Fof intentional strangulation, and also
OL,20,Fadmitted one count of controlling or
OL,21,Fcoercive behaviour.
